                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 11.3 - Safety and Protective Clothing/Equipment",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                426,
                787,
                457
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    134.0,
                    426.0
                ],
                [
                    787.0,
                    426.0
                ],
                [
                    787.0,
                    457.0
                ],
                [
                    134.0,
                    457.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Subject to availability of funding, the Employer, in accordance with applicable laws and regulations, agrees to provide all appropriate safety and protective clothing, and equipment to Employees during the performance of their assigned duties.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                486,
                1055,
                573
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    134.0,
                    486.0
                ],
                [
                    1055.0,
                    486.0
                ],
                [
                    1055.0,
                    573.0
                ],
                [
                    134.0,
                    573.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. An Employee who, after evaluation from an optometrist, is required to wear prescription eyeglasses and is required to wear these eyeglasses in order to safely accomplish their assigned duties, may provide their prescription to the Employer who will then provide the Employee with one pair of prescription safety glasses or goggles at no personal expense to the Employee, but not to exceed the amount allotted by the Agency. Employees will be responsible for paying any amount which exceeds the allowance provided by the Employer.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                597,
                1080,
                795
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    597.0
                ],
                [
                    1080.0,
                    597.0
                ],
                [
                    1080.0,
                    795.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    795.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Where required, Employees will be issued protective footwear that conforms to OSHA standards as outlined in 29 CFR 1915.156.",
            "block_bbox": [
                133,
                819,
                1015,
                876
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
